# Agent Phil Coulson: vigilance, and "{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each other Hero you control." He attacks on turn 3 without
# tapping (vigilance, CR 702.20b), then taps in the second main phase: each of Bot1's two Masked Meowers (Heroes) gets one counter;
# neither he himself ("other"), Bot1's Ornithopter (not a Hero) nor Bot2's Black Widow ("you control") does. On turn 5 he taps
# again and a second counter goes on each, so it is one counter per activation.

